...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

searcher: Searcher { class: ours }
serpapi: SerpApi { class: ext }
openai: OpenAI GPT-4o { class: ext }
editor: Editor { class: ours }

searcher -> serpapi: "search_google(query, num_results=10) ×3(검색어 3개마다)"
serpapi -> searcher: "JSON(search_results 등)"
searcher -> openai: 메시지 + 도구 결과
openai -> searcher: URL 10개 목록
searcher -> editor: URL 목록 반환
